          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<strong>What to Expect</strong>",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "text_7kMGFH": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We’ve made the couples float experience as seamless as possible for our clients in Shoreditch. When you arrive at our Float Hub location, you’ll be greeted by our friendly staff and guided to your private float room. We’ll provide a brief orientation on how the tank works and what to expect. You’ll then shower to prepare for your session.</p><p>During your float for two, you have complete control over your environment. You can choose to float in total darkness and silence for the ultimate sensory reset, or you can opt for a soft, calming light and gentle music to ease into the experience. Earplugs are provided to ensure your ears stay dry and comfortable.</p><p>After your 60-minute session, you’ll feel a profound sense of peace. You’ll have time to shower off the salt solution and then relax in our quiet post-float lounge. Many couples find that the post-float feeling of clarity and relaxation lasts for hours, if not days, allowing for better conversation and shared moments.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
